# AST Platform Roadmap
> Last updated: 2026-08-06 · Pick this up whenever ready.

---

## 🔧 Remaining UX / Technical Upgrades

| Area | What's Missing | Why It Matters |
|---|---|---|
| **Offline / PWA** | Service worker + manifest | Students lose progress on flaky connections |
| **Accessibility** | `aria-live` on score updates, keyboard nav on drag-drop & matching pairs | Compliance + usability |
| **Error boundaries** | No fallback UI if a renderer crashes mid-lesson | One broken component kills the whole lesson |
| **Read Aloud (TTS)** | Toggle exists but check all components announce content correctly | Inclusion |
| **Lesson analytics** | Time-per-slide, retry count, per-question accuracy not tracked | Tutors need this data |
| **Streak / XP persistence** | Score resets per session, not cross-session | Core retention mechanic |
| **Studio student preview** | Tutors can build but can't quickly preview as a student | Quality of life |
| **Image/video upload in Studio** | Currently requires external URLs | Reduces content creation friction |

---

## 🧩 Missing Component Renderers

### 🎮 Gamified
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| **Word Scramble** | Letters given scrambled, student arranges them — great for vocabulary |
| **Typing Racer** | Type the shown sentence fast & accurately — engagement spike |
| **Memory Grid** | Tap pairs of matching cards (classic memory game variant) |
| **Badge Reveal** | Already in category map — just needs a renderer |
| **Progress Bar** | Already in category map — just needs a renderer |
| **Spin the Wheel** | Random question selector — energises revision sessions |

### ⚡ Interactive
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| **Sequencing / Timeline** | Drag items into correct chronological or logical order |
| **Annotate Image** | Drag labels onto a diagram — science, maps, anatomy |
| **True / False** | Faster, simpler quiz variant for rapid-fire review |
| **Short Answer** | Text box + keyword auto-check or tutor-marked |
| **Word Cloud Vote** | Collaborative — students submit words, live cloud builds |
| **Categorise (Sorting Hat)** | Drop items into 2–4 labelled buckets |

### 📝 Content
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| **Callout Box** | Already in category map — check renderer exists |
| **Accordion** | Collapsible FAQ-style sections |
| **Tabs Panel** | Side-by-side comparison content |
| **Embed** | iframe for YouTube, Google Slides, Figma, Desmos, etc. |
| **Math Formula** | KaTeX/MathJax block for STEM subjects |
| **Timeline Display** | Visual chronological display (non-interactive) |
| **Quote / Pull Quote** | Featured quote with styling — literature, social studies |

### 📹 Media
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| **Audio Player** | Already in category map — confirm renderer works |
| **Interactive PDF** | Embedded PDF with annotations |

