## 🚀 Recommended Build Order

1. **Error boundary** around [ComponentRenderer](file:///c:/Users/chatz/Downloads/AST/ast4-lesson-builder/components/component-renderer.tsx#9-10) — critical stability, 30 min job
2. **True/False** — highest engagement-to-implementation ratio, ~1 day
3. **Badge Reveal renderer** — already categorised, just needs UI
4. **Callout box renderer** — educational gold for highlighting key facts
5. **Sequencing / Order** — great for science, history, coding steps
6. **Short Answer** with keyword check — open-ended viable
7. **Lesson analytics** — time-per-slide, retries, accuracy → tutor dashboard
8. **Streak / XP persistence** — cross-session via backend
